# BrainCo Revo3 Python SDK

Python bindings for the BrainCo Revo3 SDK.

## Device Scope

This package recognizes Revo3 devices only:

- Revo3 Ultra / Ultra Touch / Ultra VisionTouch
- Revo3 Pro / Pro Touch
- Revo3 Basic / Basic Touch

Runtime control is enabled for validated Revo3 Ultra 21 DOF configurations. Revo3 Pro and Revo3 Basic devices currently expose device identity and `JointLayout`; other runtime capability domains remain unavailable until separately validated.

## Installation

```bash
pip install bc-revo3-sdk
```

## Import

```python
from bc_revo3_sdk import main_mod as sdk
```

## Features

- Revo3 Manager/Hand object API for motor control, MIT control, trajectory, and teach/replay workflows
- Revo3 State and Health snapshots and pull subscriptions
- Revo3 touch module data APIs
- Modbus and CANFD connection support
- C/C++ bindings and Python type stubs

